        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-517 (ensure controlled execution — Lease Product Design, Credit Underwriting &amp; Origination (PA-96.1).) | - operational: objective TCO tool and needs-based selling
Owner: Lease Origination Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
